# TN Visual Parity loop — self-paced, read roadmap and execute first unchecked task

Read docs/TN_VISUAL_PARITY_ROADMAP.md and follow its doctrine and hard rules exactly. Do only the first unchecked [ ] task. Doctrine recap: TRUTH intact — no fake data, no placeholder logos/stock art; unmapped ticker OR failed favicon → honest 2-letter initials (onError fallback); honest-empty news stays. NO new serverless files — reuse /api/tn/[fn] + shared /api/news (region=tn); no new npm deps; no page scraping; logos come ONLY from the existing keyless DuckDuckGo favicon service via the TN_DOMAINS map. TN news stays region=tn plain list — NO outlet merge, NO images, NO hero; ONLY the header changes; legacy /api/news?q= (no params) untouched. Crypto path byte-identical — logo/header wiring is TN-only (isTN guard); the crypto header logo just shipped must NOT regress. UI: our design tokens only (--bg/--surface/--line/--text*/--accent); favicons on a white chip rounded object-contain fixed-size, onError→initials, no layout shift. Verify per task: market-ui typecheck 0 + vercel --prod (repo root) + prod curl real numbers + TN regression (BIAT board + intraday + news 200s) + crypto regression (a crypto coin e.g. TRX still shows its logo + audit spot 200/200 MISMATCH 0) + flip task [x], one Progress-log line with real numbers, commit on roadmap/world-class (git commit -F file if the message has quotes — rtk mangles them). Never git push unless asked. PERSISTENCE: never end the loop on usage/rate limit or 429/overload — stop consuming tokens immediately, ScheduleWakeup 3600s with this exact /loop prompt, and on wake re-read the ledger + Progress log and resume the same task from its last verified step (ledger + Progress log = recovery state); log partial progress BEFORE long/risky operations; chain hourly wakeups as many times as needed. Only stop for: no [ ] remaining in the ledger, or a task blocked on user-only input (credentials/infra) — then say exactly what's needed, ledger-note it, and still ScheduleWakeup 3600s so the loop resumes when unblocked.
